		TownNPCChat: {
			Mentor: {
                1: Well, {0}. Looks like {$Mods.CNC.Biome.Tranquility} has been liberated.
                2: Have you try to find the new application of crucible? This is an interesting idea.
                3: Formerly, I am a wizard too, till I meet you.
                4: Of course you can change your class, but you need to pay a higher price.
                5: In {$Mods.CNC.Biome.Tranquility}, my mind will be more active, maybe I can make some new things to relax.
			}
		}

		TownNPCMood: {
			Mentor: {
				Content: Here is good, but can be better.
				NoHome: I need a house so that I can better contimue my research.
				LoveSpace: I love this place, and I love to do what I want to do in here.
				FarFromHome: I wish I can go back to my house before sunset.
				DislikeCrowded: Actually, I don't like crowded places, too many active people will break my thinking.
				HateCrowded: It's so noisy here, worse than mobs attack!
				LikeBiome: "Living in {BiomeName} is not bad, fishing and hunting are my hobits."
				LoveBiome: "There is tranquil, but {BiomeName} more tranquil, because I can't stand those noisy neighbors."
				DislikeBiome: "{BiomeName} is a wet and smelly place, where makes me uninspired, no one would want to live there."
				HateBiome: 
				LikeNPC: "People who like elegance and fashion never resist nice clothes. I wish {NPCName} can build a clothing store on my doorway."
				LoveNPC: 
				DislikeNPC: "Voodoo Magic is just like worm, I am researching how to suppress it."
				HateNPC: "I don't like the guy in purple robe, {NPCName} has to recognize his foolish magic!"
			}
		}
		
